WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.510
A desert is a very dry place.
沙漠是非常干燥的地方。

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.060
It gets little rain.
雨水很少。

3
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:14.994
Some deserts are hot. Some deserts are cold.
有些沙漠很热。有些沙漠很冷。

4
00:00:14.994 --> 00:00:22.168
True deserts often get 25 centimeters of rain or less in a year.
真正的沙漠一年降雨常常不超过25厘米。

5
00:00:22.168 --> 00:00:27.086
That is less than the length of a school ruler!
那比一把尺子还短！

6
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:31.932
The largest desert on Earth is not hot.
地球上最大的沙漠并不热。

7
00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:36.178
It is the Antarctic Ice Sheet.
它是南极冰盖。

8
00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:41.552
Polar deserts sit near the North and South Poles.
极地沙漠靠近南北两极。
